OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few
OL,6,Fshowers continue across the north and
OL,7,Fwest but for most a dry night with
OL,8,Flong clear spells. With mainly light
OL,9,Fwinds a touch of frost is possible in
OL,10,Fthe most sheltered spots.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FA dry, largely sunny start
OL,13,Ffor most but increasing cloud and
OL,14,Fwinds turning more northwesterly and
OL,15,Ffreshening, bring afternoon showers,
OL,16,Fthese turning wintry over the
OL,17,Fmountains.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
