OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FMainly dry, bright Thursday before
OL,7,Fincreasing cloud brings occasionally
OL,8,Fheavy rain in evening. Overnight rain
OL,9,Fsoon clears leaving Friday and
OL,10,FSaturday with sunny spells and
OL,11,Fincreasingly frequent heavy, blustery
OL,12,Fshowers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
